        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.22,
          "end": 219.543,
          "en": "So to send data to the OpenAI API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.47,
          "end": 221.79,
          "en": "Before we do that though,",
